  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0: Added support for .NET 10. High-performance mediator with compiled expressions, background notifications, pipeline behaviors, file-based persistence with retry logic, and built-in ConfigureAwait(false) for automatic deadlock prevention. Safe by default for all application types. Supports .NET 9 and .NET 10.",
